## Data

`data/kitas.json` is derived from publications of the **Città di Lugano**
(City of Lugano) and from geocoding by **swisstopo / geo.admin.ch**. It is
reproduced here for the convenience of families and developers; the authoritative
source remains the City of Lugano. If you reuse it, please credit:

- Città di Lugano — <https://www.lugano.ch>
- swisstopo / geo.admin.ch — <https://api3.geo.admin.ch>

The dataset contains contact details (phone numbers, e-mail addresses, websites)
that the City of Lugano, LIS or the facilities themselves publish publicly. They
are included so that parents can reach the facilities. If you are a facility and
want a detail corrected or removed, please open an issue.

